📘
  A wrapper around the SQLite C library, written entirely in Emojicode with
  the C interface of the c package.

  Open a database with 🗃, run SQL with 🔨 and prepare statements with 📝.
  Values are passed and returned as 💎. Errors are raised as 💥.
📘

